  "citation": "Mekonnen Z; Riley W; Randerson J; Grant R; Rogers B (2024): Expansion of high-latitude deciduous forests driven by interactions between climate warming and fire: Modeling Archive. Next-Generation Ecosystem Experiments (NGEE) Arctic. Dataset. doi:10.5440/1545775",
  "dataset": {
    "@context": "http://schema.org/",
